(2) Minimize damage to public facilities and utilities, such as water and gas mains, electrical, telephone and sewer lines, streets and bridges, located in floodplains;
(3) Help maintain a stable tax base by providing for the sound use and development of floodprone areas in such a manner as to minimize flood blight areas;
